  "limitations": [
    "This independent review reads retained actual execution evidence and replays its auditors; it does not perform another native build or native execution.",
    "Only the fixed synthetic model and exact supported shapes/formats qualify; no trained-model accuracy, arbitrary model loading, framework support or native activation/cast support is established.",
    "Hidden matmul outputs are checked before explicit host ReLU/exact conversion, and actual bridge bytes feed both native output calls; row assembly is explicit host work.",
    "Native processor RTL bypasses the AFU. TFR tensor and STD scalar arithmetic are native while integer DPI helpers remain. Vendor hw_emu, physical FPGA, PPA and silicon are outside scope.",
    "Host steady-clock timestamps and simulator service intervals do not measure physical GPU latency or throughput. Host advance and waits contain or overlap other timing categories; cross-job absolute clocks are not aligned.",
    "Tensor byte counts include destination poison, but exclude argument/control staging, module/setup traffic and physical DMA transactions.",
    "Resource snapshots bracket tensor operations while the owner/module exists; owner cleanup success is separately recorded. This is not exhaustive host-heap leak or device-recovery certification.",
    "Command RSS/disk/log limits are polled process-group budgets, not cgroup or filesystem quotas. Timeout ownership is retained, and destructor draining can remain unbounded for a backend that never completes.",
    "The provenance audit checks 773 main-repository Git bodies and 57 retained source bodies per packet. External-submodule identities are recorded rather than independently rehydrated; tool/native/dependency binaries and all system headers/libraries are not archived. This does not authenticate arbitrary hardware or a hostile concurrent writer.",
    "The four older f4c6a3 executions remain incomplete retained provenance because their stamps were omitted; they are not counted in this fresh matrix. The first 7167ce1 preparation failures remain historical not_run executions.",
    "P01-A03 remains blocked and required before P07 closes. The inherited 267-to-283 DSP area-gate failure remains unresolved; no RTL, simulator, golden or tolerance change is inferred from this qualification.",
    "Final documentation/publication integrity and overall general-CI status are separate delivery obligations; this review does not declare the broad CI suite green or fabricate a human approval."
